WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:09.024
In this video, we'll open everything
we shipped: the pull request,

2
00:00:09.024 --> 00:00:13.319
the page for everyone with the
demo video, and the live app.

3
00:00:13.319 --> 00:00:16.396
This is a real run, with the waits sped up.

4
00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:24.441
One last prompt opens it all
in the integrated browser.

5
00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:32.142
The pull request on GitHub, merged,
with a summary of what changed.

6
00:00:37.682 --> 00:00:40.389
The page for everyone, on GitHub Pages.

7
00:00:40.389 --> 00:00:43.998
Anyone with the link can
see it, without signing in.

8
00:00:49.162 --> 00:00:51.659
The narrated demo video the agent recorded.

9
00:00:54.062 --> 00:00:59.699
It's twenty-six seconds long, with its
own captions, made with the demos skill.

10
00:01:08.279 --> 00:01:12.669
All four directions, side by
side, with our pick marked.

11
00:01:17.909 --> 00:01:21.189
And the live app, with the
touch-friendly toolbar as the default.

12
00:01:24.509 --> 00:01:26.968
Draw on the live site,
just like on your laptop.

13
00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:36.597
It's yours, on your own GitHub. Share
the link with the person next to you.
